# Worldline / Cardlink Subscription Payments — Complete Documentation


> Single source of truth for the Worldline (a.k.a. Cardlink, a.k.a. eurocommerce) recurring-subscription integration in this repo. Covers: how it works, the bugs we fixed (SCRUM-28), the history feature we built (SCRUM-54), every SQL migration, every changed file, all configuration, and a complete Django port guide.


