- 15/03/2026 21:22 — Sequence 1 (initial) — CAPTURED
- 14/04/2026 04:06 UTC = 07:06 Athens — Sequence 2 first attempt — REFUSED
- 14/04/2026 12:06 UTC = 15:06 Athens — Sequence 2 retry — CAPTURED
- 14/05/2026 04:06 UTC = 07:06 Athens — Sequence 3 — CAPTURED


