### 7.4 Backfill verification


```sql
SELECT "createdAt", status, source, sequence, amount, "orderId"
FROM "subscription_payment_attempts"
WHERE "subscriptionId" = 'cmms9cphl0001k1049ovvv5pz'
ORDER BY "createdAt";
-- expect 4 rows in chronological order
```


### 7.5 Rollback (only if you need to undo step 1)


⚠️ Destructive — drops the new table and types. Use only if the migration was applied by mistake.


```sql
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS "subscription_payment_attempts" CASCADE;
DROP TYPE  IF EXISTS "PaymentAttemptStatus";
DROP TYPE  IF EXISTS "PaymentAttemptSource";
```


